{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Mayhem is a 2D action and casual game featuring roguelite elements, where you select a character to battle through waves of enemies. Upgrade your arsenal by purchasing new weapons and equipment from the mysterious vending machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/0ecd63547259c0c2b6fbdad3bb221884.apng?t=1770813138\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/0ecd63547259c0c2b6fbdad3bb221884.poster.avif?t=1770813138\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/0a62a96c13d72ba14c292534f9379602.poster.avif?t=1770813138\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/0a62a96c13d72ba14c292534f9379602.webm?t=1770813138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/5cdfa82279dbb6adf485926e11dddc65.apng?t=1770813138\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/5cdfa82279dbb6adf485926e11dddc65.poster.avif?t=1770813138\" class=\"bb_img\" width=160 height=160 /></picture></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/eeef7cafd411aefbc28368509f209fc3.poster.avif?t=1770813138\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/eeef7cafd411aefbc28368509f209fc3.webm?t=1770813138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face zombies, robots, aliens and other menaces in intense battles as you unlock upgrades and unique characters. Each character comes with an exclusive passive ability and distinct stats to match your gameplay style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 60 items to create your build; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unlockable characters, besides Toby the cat; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 maps with unique mechanics; </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 different enemies and 4 bosses that grow stronger;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >14 upgrades to unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/extras/4e9ff7bfe71830a1aacc73b709e02988.avif?t=1770813138\" width=1280 height=160 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3271250?t=1770813138","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770813138","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/c01712000264d4d837a8ce3286798e70532a77f8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770813138","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3271250/c01712000264d4d837a8ce3286798e70532a77f8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770813138","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3291410,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assault Mayhem is a 2D action and casual game featuring roguelite elements, where you select a character to b